        "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
        "revision": 1368593023,
        "heading": "Toxicity",
        "text": "The Milan Poison Control Centre handled 107 R. aculeatus poisoning cases in the period 1995–2007; subsequently 4 acute poisoning cases were recorded for the 2010–2011 season in Lombardy. The majority of cases were children who had consumed the attractive berries.",
        "truncated": false
      }
    }
